Calls now carry audio. Join from the call banner and the app opens your
microphone and connects you to the other participants. A server running an
MCU is reported as unsupported instead of failing quietly, and it is
recognised before the microphone is requested. Video and the call controls
are not in this build yet.

Also fixed: the banner could never offer "Join call"; a refused microphone
was reported as unavailable; and three macOS notification faults.
